Carlito — SIL Open Font License 1.1
===================================

Vendored payload: the 4 Carlito faces (Regular / Bold / Italic /
BoldItalic), TrueType flavour, unmodified. Carlito is metric-compatible
with Calibri: a document set in Calibri keeps its line and page breaks
when Carlito takes its place.
Upstream: the Chrome OS font archive crosextrafonts-carlito-20130920
(Carlito 1.103, the build LibreOffice ships).

